{
  "id": "DP02Z",
  "version": "2.0",
  "title": "Skin cyst aspiration",
  "description": "Skin cyst aspiration is a procedure where your dermatologist uses a needle to remove fluid or material from a cyst under or on your skin. The specific approach depends on the cyst's location, size, and type. Draining a cyst relieves pressure, reduces size, and may prevent infection or rupture. The procedure takes minutes. This type of procedure can be performed various ways, including percutaneous cyst aspiration, laparoscopic ovarian cyst, and image guided, and the cost may vary depending on the specific approach or service provided.",
